    {
      "chapter": 220,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER220.YBC",
      "sha256": "ad8f1f15d9900cc15e9bac2f4f56fba60a91e0fdded33bf6ab9162d6cdec5953",
      "text_count": 11,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 200,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "text": "我們只要再前進一步，\n就可以到達白皙的城砦了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 224,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "然而，就像「雙子鐵璧」他們說的一樣，\n那通往白皙城砦的道路已經被封閉了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 248,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "恐怕那是一個以「匍伏蔓延而來之物」作為觸\n媒而維持的封印。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 272,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "解開那古雷納汀的封印吧。\n然後往安蒂米昂的方向前進。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 290,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "是的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 220,
          "source_offset": 314,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "往那養育了我們所有人，\n能讓我們好好休息的家前進。"
        }
      ],
